  <History Date="28-04-14" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Created" />
  <History Date="14-05-19" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added Atlabase ID's.  Added product thumbnail.  Revised P/T Speed in line with latest charts." />
  <History Date="14-05-19" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Changed no function to zoom speed in line with latest charts." />
  <History Date="14-05-19" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added col mac mode with alternative colour macros.  Ideally this needs to be moved into separate modes." />
